  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><a href=\"https://fizzyart.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Fizzy Art</strong></a> is an online retailer of premium wall art and posters for the home.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We supply a wide range of styles and sizes from a huge selection of well known artists.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Customers love our curated gallery sets, this takes the hard work of choosing individual prints. We carefully select sets of 2, 3 and 6 prints that perfectly compliment each other in colour pallete and style. We do still offer individual prints to allow customers to choose their own sets if they so wish.<br><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We offer our affilates 10% commission on each order referred, with average order values between &pound;100-&pound;120.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">All payments are made automatically and safely via PayPal.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Should you have any further questions please feel free to contact us directly.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"></p>",
